{
  "scenario_brief": "TEST: Ops privilege\n\nA test floor for the privilege stage of the ops core (OPS_PRIVILEGE_ACCOUNTS_PLAN.md, S5a). A lobby with a drop box, a wall port and a cabinet; a bay with an owned desk PC, a USB socket and a stick port; a store room with a records server and two staff accounts. Sign in as an ordinary account, then as the administrator, and see what the administrator can do that the ordinary account cannot. Nothing to solve.",
